  "distance_km": 6.9,
  "description": "This circular walk climbs to Moel y Faen and Moel Y Gamelin in the Clwydian Range. You can start off from the car park on the Horseshoe Pass road just to the east of the mountain. From here you can pick up trails heading west past the Moel y Faen quarries to the 548 metre summit of Moel y Faen. The route continues south west to Moel Y Gamelin which stands at a height of 577 metres. From here you can enjoy some wonderful views over the surrounding Dee Valley National Landscape.You then descend to the north to pick up a nice country lane which will lead you back to the car park.You can extend the walk by continuing up to the nearbyMoel Morfydd.",
